{"title": "Slayer's Improved Extra Attack", "pageid": 31846, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Slayer's_Improved_Extra_Attack", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extra_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp/300px-Extra_Attack.webp, /w/images/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp/300px-Extra_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Slayer's Improved Extra Attack</b> is a passive feature available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a>, granting it two additional attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can make two additional attacks after attacking with your main-hand weapon. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer\" title=\"Slayer\">Slayer</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description, there is no requirement for the attack to use a weapon. See <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slayer%27s_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Slayer's Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slayer's Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slayer%27s_Extra_Attack\" title=\"Slayer's Extra Attack\">Slayer's Extra Attack</a> for the mechanics of how this ability works.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 735/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5039/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2575/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 166/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 676369/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.419      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.419      1 -total\n 44.76%   13.617      1 Template:SmPass\n 15.54%    4.728      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.18%    4.618      1 Template:Passive_inline/format\n 14.19%    4.316      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.06%    4.276      1 Template:Icon_link\n 12.98%    3.950      1 Template:Icon_text\n 10.93%    3.325      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.84%    2.992      2 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31846-0!ca